Title: What They Called Recovery
Credit: Animated feature screenplay — individual review draft
Author: Christopher Kokkinos
Draft date: 2026-09-28
Status: Individual scene draft; whole-film pass provisionally accepted, individual author review pending

INT. SAFEGUARDING OFFICE/ZOE'S TEMPORARY ROOM - DAY

Jackie tells CLAIRE what she wants recorded: protect her siblings, no unwanted participants, no premature contact with anyone claiming to speak for her. Claire writes it down.

Priya and other investigators look for a way to hear Zoe outside Mac's, the carers' and Elias's claims. Zoe checks a possible contact and speaks to RUTH. Ruth admits what she does not yet know and starts a separate record of Zoe's wishes. Zoe can say "I don't know" about where she will live.

Jackie may choose when to see Zoe. Zoe accepts that a process she cannot command can still protect her friend. Elias stays beside her without asking Ruth to treat his account as hers.
